    <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;A table view with user's variables in Scipyen's workspace.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;CAUTION:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:400;&quot;&gt;Not all variables are visible. Notable hidden variables are: `_`, `__`, and objects created at start up (imported modules, functions and variables which are NOT necessarily global). &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:400;&quot;&gt;To see all the contents of the workspace at any time, execute `dir()` in Scipyen's console.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
